{"case_id": "prime-check", "trial": 1, "condition": "candidate", "runner": "x-gemini-3.1-high", "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "runner_sha256": "24cb0f83ed4563d12cd13efe43a94f602801e8757249f6758b98c81c8355483c", "cases_sha256": "f52b0e4983a2815e81bb5c003273844a54d4f981a486087bd8986a85f2d6653b", "style_sha256": "7ac0e9b2cec88eb23b8fa71910242c02cecfae607e65524b583d27557a61d4ea", "response": "```python\ndef is_prime(n: int) -> bool:\n    if n <= 1:\n        return False\n    if n <= 3:\n        return True\n    if n % 2 == 0 or n % 3 == 0:\n        return False\n    i = 5\n    while i * i <= n:\n        if n % i == 0 or n % (i + 2) == 0:\n            return False\n        i += 6\n    return True\n```", "usage": {"input": 75037, "output": 675, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "totalTokens": 75712, "reasoningTokens": 560, "cost": {"input": 0.15007399999999999, "output": 0.0081, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.15817399999999998}}, "cost_usd": 0.158174}
